  "description": "U-Rim’s whole world used to revolve around the popular idol Ga-Ron. But after meeting Ju-Yeol in college, he fell head over heels for him so much so that he was on the verge of dropping out of school. With his good looks, sharp mind, and talent for playing in a band, Ju-Yeol is simply perfect! U-Rim, thrilled to accept his invitation to a band practice, encounters a suspicious figure loitering outside the door. But this suspicious stranger was actually my favorite idol, Ga-Ron?! Just as he found himself with Ga-Ron, U-Rim noticed an alert for Ga-Ron’s live stream. He was puzzled by the stark contrast between his dazzling appearance on the live feed and the shabby-looking Ga-Ron standing right in front of him. Ga-Ron manages to escape the crisis with a flustered excuse, but, fearing that U-Rim might expose his secret, he stubbornly insists on staying at U-Rim’s house. U-Rim grows even more suspicious of Ga-Ron’s behavior… Ga-Ron’s true identity is slowly revealed! What secret does my favorite idol on the other side of the screen have…?!\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
